GUI_TC13.steps:
Enable OSPFv2;
Check the checkbox "advertise connected networks";
Modify the metric to 0,1,2,16777213, 16777214, 16777215;

GUI_TC14.steps:
Enable RIP;
Check the checkbox "Redistribute OSPF Routes";
Modify the metric to 0,1,2,15,16;

